"A warm living space with evening lighting, layered lamps, textured fabrics, wooden surfaces, comfortable furniture arrangement, intimate atmosphere, realistic lighting, cinematic mood" = "Et varmt opholdsrum med aftenbelysning, lagdelte lamper, teksturerede stoffer, træoverflader, behagelig møbelopstilling, intim atmosfære, realistisk belysning, filmatisk stemning";
